  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/messengers-infobip-sdk (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime and executes a 727KB obfuscated payload (math_init.js) that is unrelated to the SDK's stated SMS/MMS messaging purpose. The payload is encrypted with a custom string-table cipher, making its behaviour opaque to inspection. The install-time execution of an obfuscated, undocumented payload on every install is the malicious behaviour; the actual SDK code in dist/ is clean and does not require Bun.",
